          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "DATA DUMMY: ganti dengan data asli sebelum publish",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Instrument Sans",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "R4Al9",
          "name": "Item",
          "fill": "#D0D0D0",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Proyek Bank Raya: judul 'Digital banking app', cakupan e-KYC, BI-FAST, riwayat transaksi, dan '200+ case regression suite, run every sprint'.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Instrument Sans",
          "fontSize": 15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "slyhx",
          "name": "Item",
          "fill": "#D0D0D0",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Metrik BCA: MCB '120+ test cases across 3 release cycles', EDC '60+ transaction scenarios on 4 terminal models', OASE '80+ scenarios, signed off in 2 UAT cycles', ACCO '95+ scenarios, 14 defects caught before UAT sign-off'.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Instrument Sans",
          "fontSize": 15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Na86J",
          "name": "Item",
          "fill": "#D0D0D0",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Sample work: test case TC-KOP-014 (bulk file upload 500 baris) dan bug report BUG-KOP-221 (payroll terdebit dua kali saat retry), keduanya dari Kopra.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Instrument Sans",
          "fontSize": 15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cbKBk",
          "name": "Item",
          "fill": "#D0D0D0",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• How I work (Lite): 3 prinsip kerja. Ini opini/gaya, pastikan sesuai cara kerja kamu.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Instrument Sans",
          "fontSize": 15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "yGab4",
          "name": "Item",
          "fill": "#D0D0D0",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Fakta asli (bukan dummy): 150+ scenarios dan 0 critical bugs Kopra, 6+ critical apps BCA, semua jabatan, tahun, tools dan sertifikasi.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Instrument Sans",
          "fontSize": 15
        }
      ]
